[Desktop Entry]
Version=1.0
Type=Application
Name=Close Fixation Cross
GenericName=Hide fMRI Fixation Target
Comment=Closes the resting-state fixation from the console. Works even though the BOLDscreen window never holds keyboard focus (sends a signal, not a keypress).
Exec=pkill -f FixationCross.png
